<div class="section_content content" id="7685895_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">All prior ordinances and local laws or portions thereof of the City of Albany relative to the imposition of fines and other penalties for the violation of parking regulations are hereby repealed.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
